{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12785","headline":"送孙泼赴云中 · 韩翃","name":"送孙泼赴云中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄骢少年舞双戟，目视旁人皆辟易。\n百战能夸陇上儿，一身复作云中客。\n寒风动地气苍茫，横吹先悲出塞长。\n敲石军中传夜火，斧冰河畔汲朝浆。\n前锋直指阴山外，虏骑纷纷胆应碎。\n匈奴破尽人看归，金印酬功如斗大。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}